{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blaze of Storm is a standard vertical scrolling shmup. The main character, a pilot, fights against enemies in cyberspace as a cyber diver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two types of weapons are available: a main weapon and a subweapon. The main weapon is a Vulcan shot that is fired in front of the player's ship. The subweapon type can be changed by getting an item.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Subweapons have different performance depending on their type. Some circle around the ship to defend against enemy bullets, others automatically track and attack the enemy, and so on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition, subweapons can generate an explosion by hitting the enemy with the weapon itself, and this explosion can cause great damage to the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies appear in cyberspace in a wide variety of shapes, including mecha, creatures, and plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a shmup in which you can take advantage of the properties of subweapons and their explosions to your advantage. Stay tuned!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3513070?t=1739235464","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3513070?t=1739235464","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513070/10550acd2b76b45b620bd53fe97a3266c0dcb9d4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739235464","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513070/10550acd2b76b45b620bd53fe97a3266c0dcb9d4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739235464","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blaze of Storm is a standard vertical scrolling shmup. The main character, a pilot, fights against enemies in cyberspace as a cyber diver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two types of weapons are available: a main weapon and a subweapon. The main weapon is a Vulcan shot that is fired in front of the player's ship. The subweapon type can be changed by getting an item.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Subweapons have different performance depending on their type. Some circle around the ship to defend against enemy bullets, others automatically track and attack the enemy, and so on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition, subweapons can generate an explosion by hitting the enemy with the weapon itself, and this explosion can cause great damage to the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies appear in cyberspace in a wide variety of shapes, including mecha, creatures, and plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a shmup in which you can take advantage of the properties of subweapons and their explosions to your advantage. Stay tuned!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["TERARIN GAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513070/header.jpg?t=1739235464","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9TERARIN GAMES","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Blaze of Storm","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> windows11,10,8,7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> CPU 1.5GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1280 x 720<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 130 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> 